  src/cli/runtime/refusal-credential-redaction.ts,project,REJECTED_CREDENTIALS_STEP replaces the restore step when the refusal rejected the credentials (GH-1757)
  src/core/shared/errors.ts,project,PmCliErrorContext.url_credentials_rejected
  src/core/shared/url-credentials.ts,project,identity refusal declares url_credentials_rejected; requirement text carries no credential-shaped sample
  tests/integration/cli/credential-redaction.integration.spec.ts,project,"GH-1757 --author, text rendering, PM_AUTHOR and successful plain replay"
  tests/unit/cli/runtime/refusal-credential-redaction.spec.ts,project,"rejected-credential step, idempotence, clean pass-through"
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/cli/runtime/refusal-credential-redaction.spec.ts tests/integration/cli/credential-redaction.integration.spec.ts tests/unit/core/shared/url-credentials.spec.ts,project,400,"harness:claude-code","2026-11-20T04:53:44.489Z",local_mutation,fix/diagnostic-population-truth
close_reason: Identity refusals caused by URL credentials steer to a replay without them instead of advising their restoration
contract_change:
  api: PmCliErrorContext.url_credentials_rejected and identity refusal next_steps
  before: "A refusal of an identity carrying URL userinfo (--author, PM_AUTHOR, --assignee and other identity options) led its next_steps with restoring the redacted credentials, and its requirement text held a credential-shaped sample that redaction rewrote"
  after: "Such refusals set url_credentials_rejected: { source }; their first next step names that source, says its credentials caused the refusal and must not be restored, and asks to restore any other redacted credentials; a PM_AUTHOR refusal whose command line carries no credential has only the plain-name step"
  migrate: "Agents and clients matching the old restore-them step text for identity refusals should follow the source-specific step; producers whose refusal rejects URL credentials themselves set url_credentials_rejected: { source } on the PmCliError context"
escape_class: production_defect
gate_evidence:
  disposition: gate_strengthened
  owner: pm-gh1757
  gate_id: test-coverage
  negative_control: Without the url_credentials_rejected marker the GH-1757 specs in tests/unit/cli/runtime/refusal-credential-redaction.spec.ts and tests/integration/cli/credential-redaction.integration.spec.ts fail on the restore-them step; with the old credential-shaped requirement text the PM_AUTHOR case fails on a redacted required field and an added credential step
  local_checks[4]: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/cli/runtime/refusal-credential-redaction.spec.ts tests/integration/cli/credential-redaction.integration.spec.ts tests/unit/core/shared/url-credentials.spec.ts,node scripts/run-tests.mjs test,pnpm typecheck,node scripts/sdk-surface-snapshot.mjs --check
  hosted_checks[2]: CI / Gates (static),CI / Gates (coverage)
